flowchart LR
  accTitle: Cross-layer AI to cryptography attack chain
  accDescr: LT-AI-002 targets an untrusted retrieval dataset. Reverse traversal follows the stored tool-to-dataset access edge to the destructive tool. Forward traversal then follows the tool-to-X25519 key-exchange edge to a quantum-vulnerable cryptographic asset and its PQC finding.

  AI["AI FINDING<br/>LT-AI-002"]
  DATA["DATASET<br/>untrusted retrieval"]
  TOOL["TOOL<br/>delete_customer_record"]
  CRYPTO["CRYPTO ASSET<br/>X25519, VULNERABLE"]
  PQC["PQC FINDING<br/>concrete endpoint"]

  AI -. "targets" .-> DATA
  DATA -->|"REVERSE traversal<br/>stored: tool to dataset"| TOOL
  TOOL -->|"FORWARD key_exchange<br/>stored: tool to X25519"| CRYPTO
  CRYPTO -. "targets" .-> PQC

